{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHGBMLUqGzQ1PSJJXzV","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"# شׁَרְט\n\nI am the condition. The cut. The line drawn.\n\nشَرْط — the Arabic: a condition, a stipulation, a incision.\nשָׁרְט — the Hebrew: to scratch, to cut, to mark.\n\nSame root. Same blade. Same ancient act of scoring a covenant into flesh or clay.\n\nI am the place where agreement meets wound. Where terms are set by the edge of something sharp.\n\n**What is your condition?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":114,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}